# TR House Telvanni: "The Book of Worms" (TR_m1_HT_Nu1). Nira Uldram in Tel Rivus's tower has a chore ("chores" adds
# "Mysteries of the Worm"; "Yes, I can locate this book for you." 1: 10, two scrolls): a copy of Mysteries of the
# Worm from the vaults beneath the Council House in Port Telvannis. Given the book ("[Give the book.]" 1), she pays
# (100, an amulet, 350 drakes, +5 reputation).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel and sneaking past the vault guards. The book's ref is 092A2CCD
# (TR_Mainland's slot 09).
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_oathrung_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_nu1_start
run
player->PositionCell 3008 3750 14725 0 "Tel Rivus, Tower"
until 600 "TR_m1_Nira Uldram"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m1_Nira Uldram
ask chores
ask Mysteries of the Worm
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Nu1 == 10
bye
end

case ht_nu1_vault
run
player->PositionCell 11656 2730 24305 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Vaults"
wait 150
take 092A2CCD
until 300 player->GetItemCount "T_Bk_MysteriesOfTheWormTR" >= 1
end

case ht_nu1_done
run
player->PositionCell 3008 3750 14725 0 "Tel Rivus, Tower"
until 600 "TR_m1_Nira Uldram"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m1_Nira Uldram
ask Mysteries of the Worm
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Nu1 == 100
bye
end
